    kind: work_item  # 4c09
    title: "INV-fahub D facet: gate unresolvable-receiver calls (exists/startsWith/toString @0.85) to unresolved; needs var-type tracking (or defer)"  # 4c09
    status: todo_hard  # 4c09
    priority: 2  # 4c09
    parent: INV-fahub-himis-zuzug-zijus-sahof-kabol-nolad-kakit  # 4c09
