  nonce: f8bf  # f8bf
  message: "Done — merged to dev (36ef4ec6d1). D UFCS receiver gating via the receiver_type_dispatch substrate: d_lang.py tracks function-parameter types, gates variable-receiver calls (thing.exists()) to make_unresolved_edge+receiver_type_hint (suppressing the 0.85 misbind to a bare exists()), and stamps free functions with meta.ufcs_receiver_type (first-param type) so the linker recovers the real UFCS target as ast_call_ufcs. Behavioral evidence: test_d_ufcs_receiver_gating.py — the funnel case (File-typed param receiver) recovers via the linker, the misbind case (no matching UFCS free fn) is suppressed (0 resolved edges to the bare fn), module/bare calls unaffected. 100% coverage; 20966 affected tests green. RESIDUAL (documented): local-variable and auto receivers are not tracked (parameter receivers are the dominant funnel) — a UFCS-aware follow-up could extend var-type tracking to typed local decls + return types."  # f8bf
