  message: "Reopened (real-repro validation 2026-07-18, on the item OWN corpus dub=~/ALL_REPOS/repos_Apr12_2026/dub, fresh post-fix code): D funnels still wide open. 107 exists/startsWith/toString calls resolve @0.85 (ast_call_direct) to arbitrary internal defs. Magnet: toString<-25 src files, startsWith<-19, exists<-13->a NESTED-LOCAL exists (compilers/utils.d:124, invisible outside its scope). Ground truth: commandline.d:1172 `l.startsWith(\"-\")` on a string loop-var means std.algorithm.startsWith, binds to internal sdlang helper. Cause: the gate only fires when receiver is a typed function PARAMETER (var_types); misses free-function-form (receiver=None) + UFCS on locals/loop-vars/fields. Only 1 ufcs+36 type_inferred legit; 75 suppressed. Design pending 3-lens investigation."  # 1770
